</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Foundation Agents</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt templates used for the deterministic and stochastic LLM agents are almost identical. While the deterministic agent receives the exact position where the reward is located, the stochastic agent is only told the following: <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Your goal is to reach the reward located at a random coordinate as quickly as possible.</span> See Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> for the full prompt used by the deterministic LLM agent. The agent’s memory is filled as it interacts with the game. Whenever an action is executed, we add the following line to the memory: <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Executed &lt;ACTION&gt; at &lt;LOCATION&gt; resulting in &lt;NEW LOCATION&gt; and no reward.</span> Additionally, as seen in Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>, whenever an agent chooses an action, it outputs a plan representing its thoughts. We add each plan to the memory as well.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST5" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="LST5.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel">The prompt template for the deterministic LLM agent.</p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="LST5.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_figure_panel ltx_lst_language_JavaScript ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="prompts/llm_agents/deterministic_llm_agent.txt">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx84" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx84.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx84.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context</span><span id="lstnumberx84.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">**</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx85" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx85.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx85.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx85.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">an</span><span id="lstnumberx85.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">agent</span><span id="lstnumberx85.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">in</span><span id="lstnumberx85.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx85.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx85.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx85.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">n</span><span id="lstnumberx85.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx85.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">x</span><span id="lstnumberx85.17" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx85.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">n</span><span id="lstnumberx85.19" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx85.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space