<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The full list of numerical results for the FA performances from the experiments in Section <a href="#S4.SS2" title="4.2 Decision-Making ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Foundation Models as World Models: A Foundational Study in Text-Based GridWorlds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a> can be found in Table <a href="#A4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix D Additional Foundation Agent Results ‣ Foundation Models as World Models: A Foundational Study in Text-Based GridWorlds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. Further, a visualization of the deterministic gridworld performances can be found in Figure <a href="#A4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix D Additional Foundation Agent Results ‣ Foundation Models as World Models: A Foundational Study in Text-Based GridWorlds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
